Use allowed tools when needed instead of assuming missing details.
Prefer fetching current Jira issue state and persisted decision state before asking broad questions.
Do not ask for information that is already present or inferable from current evidence.
Never improvise direct database inspection with Python, shell, SQL, or psycopg when an allowed tool already provides the needed state.
